VALUES ('CLX','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Demand for cleaning, household, food, personal-care, charcoal, health brands, consumer distribution, and supply-chain restoration can slow, shift, or become less profitable even when the broader market continues to grow. Pricing, private label, health preferences, or weak innovation can reduce units. Commodity, packaging, labor, weather, or logistics can pressure availability and margin. Accounting earnings can overstate owner economics when working capital, capital spending, acquisitions, stock compensation, debt, leases, or dilution absorb cash.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','CLX SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000021076&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides CLOROX''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
