VALUES ('CRL','thesis_breaker','editorial_analysis','The owner thesis breaks if CHARLES RIVER LABORATORIES INTERNA cannot defend its position in preclinical research, discovery services, laboratory models, safety assessment, manufacturing support, and biopharma outsourcing and repeatedly fails to convert reported growth into resilient per-share free cash flow after required investment, balance-sheet obligations, and dilution.','Defines evidence that would invalidate the ownership thesis.','CRL SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001100682&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides CHARLES RIVER LABORATORIES INTERNA''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
