VALUES ('CRWV','bull_case','editorial_analysis','Revenue increased 112% year over year to $2.08 billion in Q1 2026, while backlog reached $99.4 billion. CoreWeave surpassed 1 GW of active power and reported more than 3.5 GW of contracted power, creating a visible physical path for additional capacity. NVIDIA invested $2.0 billion at $87.20 per share and expanded its technology collaboration with CoreWeave across future platform generations. Q1 operating cash flow rose to $2.98 billion as customer collections increased, demonstrating that contracted capacity can generate meaningful cash before growth investment.','Preserves the constructive interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','CoreWeave First-Quarter 2026 Results','https://investors.coreweave.com/news/news-details/2026/CoreWeave-Reports-Strong-First-Quarter-2026-Results/','Management reported $99.4B of revenue backlog, more than 1 GW of active power, over 3.5 GW of contracted power, and new or expanded agreements with Meta, Anthropic, Cohere, Jane Street, and Mistral.','2026-08-01','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
