VALUES ('CSGP','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Demand for commercial real-estate data, marketplaces, analytics, property research, subscription software, and digital advertising can slow, shift, or become less profitable even when the broader market continues to grow. Vacancy, churn, customer consolidation, or property obsolescence can reduce cash flow. Leverage and maturities expose owners to rates and capital-market availability. Accounting earnings can overstate owner economics when working capital, capital spending, acquisitions, stock compensation, debt, leases, or dilution absorb cash.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','CSGP SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001057352&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides COSTAR GROUP INC''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
