VALUES ('CTVA','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Demand for seeds, crop protection, biologicals, traits, digital agronomy, and agricultural productivity solutions can slow, shift, or become less profitable even when the broader market continues to grow. Prices and volumes can move faster than the cost base adjusts. Mines, plants, logistics, safety, or remediation can interrupt output and require cash. Accounting earnings can overstate owner economics when working capital, capital spending, acquisitions, stock compensation, debt, leases, or dilution absorb cash.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','CTVA SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001755672&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides CORTEVA INC''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
