VALUES ('DECK','thesis_breaker','editorial_analysis','The owner thesis breaks if DECKERS OUTDOOR CORP cannot defend its position in premium footwear and apparel brands, direct-to-consumer retail, wholesale, global distribution, and product innovation and repeatedly fails to convert reported growth into resilient per-share free cash flow after required investment, balance-sheet obligations, and dilution.','Defines evidence that would invalidate the ownership thesis.','DECK SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000910521&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides DECKERS OUTDOOR CORP''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
