VALUES ('DGX','thesis_breaker','editorial_analysis','The owner thesis breaks if QUEST DIAGNOSTICS INC cannot defend its position in diagnostic testing, clinical laboratories, genetics, pathology, employer health services, and healthcare information solutions and repeatedly fails to convert reported growth into resilient per-share free cash flow after required investment, balance-sheet obligations, and dilution.','Defines evidence that would invalidate the ownership thesis.','DGX SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001022079&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides QUEST DIAGNOSTICS INC''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
