VALUES ('DIS','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Content and franchise execution can weaken the owner outcome; monitor audience, box office, engagement, production cost, and franchise health. Linear decline and sports rights can weaken the owner outcome; monitor subscribers, affiliate rates, advertising, rights renewals, and dtc economics. Parks capital and consumer cycle can weaken the owner outcome; monitor attendance, pricing, capex, travel demand, and return on new capacity. A valuation that assumes flawless execution can fall even when the underlying business remains viable.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','DIS SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001744489&owner=exclude','Walt Disney Co filings provide the audited financial record, business description, material risks, commitments, governance, and current reports.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
