VALUES ('ELV','thesis_breaker','editorial_analysis','The owner thesis breaks if ELEVANCE HEALTH INC cannot defend its position in commercial, government, and individual health benefits plus pharmacy, care-delivery, and health-service platforms and repeatedly fails to convert reported growth into resilient per-share free cash flow after required investment, balance-sheet obligations, and dilution.','Defines evidence that would invalidate the ownership thesis.','ELV SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001156039&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides ELEVANCE HEALTH INC''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
