VALUES ('EOG','bull_case','editorial_analysis','EOG RESOURCES INC''s position in oil and natural-gas exploration and production focused on high-return U.S. resource plays can compound value if demand converts into durable share, pricing, and cash rather than temporary volume. Asset quality, scale, integration, logistics, acreage, contracts, technology, and operating execution can create cost or market-access advantages. Operating leverage and disciplined reinvestment can expand per-share free cash flow when revenue quality, margins, and capital intensity improve together. Official filings and earnings materials create a quarterly scorecard for testing management''s claims against delivered results and cash conversion.','Preserves the constructive interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','EOG official investor materials','https://investors.eogresources.com/','Use the company''s official results, presentations, webcast replays, prepared remarks, and transcripts when the issuer makes them publicly available.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
