VALUES ('EOG','thesis_breaker','editorial_analysis','The owner thesis breaks if EOG RESOURCES INC cannot defend its position in oil and natural-gas exploration and production focused on high-return U.S. resource plays and repeatedly fails to convert reported growth into resilient per-share free cash flow after required investment, balance-sheet obligations, and dilution.','Defines evidence that would invalidate the ownership thesis.','EOG SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000821189&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides EOG RESOURCES INC''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
