VALUES ('ETN','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Cycle and backlog quality can weaken the owner outcome; monitor cancellations, project timing, book-to-bill, lead times, and pricing. Capacity execution can weaken the owner outcome; monitor factory cost, labor, suppliers, quality, and utilization. Competition and substitution can weaken the owner outcome; monitor price, specification, alternative technology, and share. A valuation that assumes flawless execution can fall even when the underlying business remains viable.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','ETN SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001551182&owner=exclude','Eaton Corp plc filings provide the audited financial record, business description, material risks, commitments, governance, and current reports.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
