VALUES ('EVRG','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Demand for regulated electric utilities, generation, transmission, distribution, grid modernization, reliability, and clean-energy investment can slow, shift, or become less profitable even when the broader market continues to grow. Bills, politics, and customer pressure can delay or reduce recovery. Large generation, grid, and environmental projects can face delays or cost overruns. Accounting earnings can overstate owner economics when working capital, capital spending, acquisitions, stock compensation, debt, leases, or dilution absorb cash.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','EVRG SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001711269&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides EVERGY INC''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
